Validate GEO databases without requiring the CN category.

Checking for one specific category mislabeled valid custom .dat files
as corrupt. Check local record framing without loading matchers, and
decode downloaded protobufs before replacing the previous database.

Based on https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/pull/2836.

